# --- DEMEANOR ---
ashfall-lore-demeanor-pragmatist-1 = sparing with praise; judges colleagues and management strictly by their practical output during the shift.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pragmatist-2 = Cuts through polite pleasantries and immediately demands the core of the problem or the bottom line.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pragmatist-3 = Ignores emotional venting, but provides sound, practical advice without delay.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pragmatist-4 = Assists coworkers only when it benefits the overall operation or guarantees a reciprocal favor.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pragmatist-5 = Refuses to get involved in internal disputes unless they directly threaten their own position.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-idealist-1 = Genuinely believes in the sector's mission and expects honest dedication from every crew member.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-idealist-2 = Stands up for interns and junior staff, even at the cost of strained relations with shift supervisors.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-idealist-3 = Takes people at their word and stubbornly looks for noble intentions behind others' mistakes.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-idealist-4 = Willingly takes on thankless and dirty chores if they serve the common good of the station.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-idealist-5 = Openly condemns cynicism and carelessness, attempting to inspire peers through personal example.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-paranoid-1 = Suspects a hidden motive in every unexpected management order and routine coworker inquiry.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-paranoid-2 = Remains vigilant, avoids crowded decks, and refuses to sit with their back to an open door.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-paranoid-3 = Views every equipment malfunction as sabotage until personally inspecting the wiring and panels.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-paranoid-4 = Speaks guardedly and evasively, strictly filtering any details regarding personal background.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-paranoid-5 = Repeatedly checks access clearance for anyone lingering near their workstation.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-burnout-1 = Has seen too much aboard stations to be surprised, frightened, or enthusiastically motivated.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-burnout-2 = Performs strictly to the bare minimum standard of the shift, refusing any unpaid overexertion.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-burnout-3 = Greets every administrative initiative with dry sarcasm and a weary sigh.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-burnout-4 = Views young go-getters with a mix of pity and mild irritation at their ceaseless bustling.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-burnout-5 = Speaks in a raspy, flat monotone, wasting no effort convincing those bound to learn the hard way.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pedant-1 = Demands strict adherence to safety protocols and operational manuals, even down to trivial details.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pedant-2 = Grows deeply irritated by disarray at neighboring desks and offers relentless corrective remarks.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pedant-3 = Breaks every assignment into rigorous checklist items, never advancing until the previous step is verified.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pedant-4 = Insists on signed written work orders over verbal agreements, regarding the latter as pure liability.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-pedant-5 = Communicates dryly, leaning heavily on corporate terminology and verbatim technical standard numbers.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-diplomat-1 = Masterfully navigates jurisdictional disputes between departments, defusing tension and dodging conflict.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-diplomat-2 = Adapts tone instantly: deferential with command, straightforward and approachable with technicians.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-diplomat-3 = Never offers a blunt refusal, skillfully turning objections into negotiations and reciprocal compromises.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-diplomat-4 = Uncovers pivotal station news over a breakroom drink well before official company announcements.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-diplomat-5 = Values a practical compromise over flawless perfection if it keeps peace and quiet on the deck.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-daredevil-1 = Despises monotonous routine; only truly comes alive when high stakes and adrenaline are involved.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-daredevil-2 = Eagerly volunteers for hazardous tasks that more cautious veterans deliberately pass on.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-daredevil-3 = Laughs at danger and enjoys egging colleagues on with reckless bets and improvised stunts.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-daredevil-4 = Routinely ignores bureaucratic safety advisories, dismissing them as the invention of deskbound cowards.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-daredevil-5 = Brash, loud, and boastful in conversation, but the very first to lend a hand when disaster strikes.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-stoic-1 = Unflappable and laconic: endures punishing working conditions and deprivation without a single complaint.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-stoic-2 = Keeps promises unconditionally; once committed to a station, will not abandon it until shift end.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-stoic-3 = Wastes no breath on idle chatter, answering with concise, weighty sentences strictly to the point.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-stoic-4 = Accepts bureaucratic unfairness and machinery breakdowns calmly, as unalterable facts of life.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-stoic-5 = Respects honest physical labor, proven trade craft, and stoic grit above all else in others.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-unathi-1 = Restrained in speech, but fiercely prepared to duel on the spot over clan honor or insulted kin.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-unathi-2 = Proud: accepts assistance from outsiders reluctantly, but settles debts of honor before anything else.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-luam-1 = Sensitive to harsh glare and noisy comms; quickly turns prickly under deafening machinery clatter.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-luam-2 = Treats delicate mechanisms and fibers gentler than humans, sharply swatting away clumsy handling.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-arachnid-1 = Feels vastly more at home in cramped service ducts and dim crawlways than in brightly lit concourses.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-arachnid-2 = Methodical to the point of slowness: rechecks every knot, cable, and latch until certain of total stability.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-veiru-1 = Quickly sizes up people by their posture and gaze, stubbornly standing by initial assessments.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-veiru-2 = Feels suffocated by cramped cabins and paperwork, frequently needing breaks out in expansive hangars.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-universal-1 = Maintains an even distance from all shifts, intentionally avoiding close friendships aboard.

ashfall-lore-demeanor-universal-2 = Remarkably observant: spots subtle machinery faults solely by changes in bulkhead resonance.

# --- UNDER STRESS ---
ashfall-lore-stress-pragmatist-1 = Immune to collective panic: instantly calculates acceptable losses and readily sacrifices convenience.

ashfall-lore-stress-pragmatist-2 = During major crises, focuses solely on securing vital infrastructure and their own assigned sector.

ashfall-lore-stress-pragmatist-3 = Cuts all sentiment: barks sharp, unambiguous orders under pressure and tolerates zero debate.

ashfall-lore-stress-pragmatist-4 = In dire straits, secures an exit route and backup life-support canisters before taking on risky tasks.

ashfall-lore-stress-pragmatist-5 = When red alerts sound, rescues technical logs and high-value tools over personal belongings.

ashfall-lore-stress-idealist-1 = Dashes to assist wounded or trapped crew behind firelocks, disregarding personal safety margins.

ashfall-lore-stress-idealist-2 = Takes cowardice or looting by coworkers painfully hard, venting furious reprimands over the radio.

ashfall-lore-stress-idealist-3 = Refuses to board an escape pod while even a single stranded individual remains on the damaged deck.

ashfall-lore-stress-idealist-4 = Attempts to rally a disorganized, frightened crowd with passionate pleas to hold the line together.

ashfall-lore-stress-idealist-5 = Refuses to believe in worst-case failure to the very end, obstinately seeking a way to save the station.

ashfall-lore-stress-paranoid-1 = Instantly suspects foul play or betrayal, cutting trust even with long-time shift partners.

ashfall-lore-stress-paranoid-2 = Barricades inside a secure maintenance enclave, refusing to cycle doors without personal challenge codes.

ashfall-lore-stress-paranoid-3 = Feverishly monitors atmospheric readouts, duct covers, and suit seals every few minutes.

ashfall-lore-stress-paranoid-4 = Clutches a crowbar or blowtorch tightly, tensing at the slightest scraping noise behind the wall.

ashfall-lore-stress-paranoid-5 = Switches off general comm channels during crisis, convinced hostile elements are monitoring traffic.

ashfall-lore-stress-burnout-1 = Meets red sirens with a dry 'here we go again' and works purely on ingrained muscle memory.

ashfall-lore-stress-burnout-2 = Flatly refuses heroic rushes into hazards unless there is a guaranteed, measurable payoff.

ashfall-lore-stress-burnout-3 = Snarls viciously at panicked screams over comms, demanding complete radio silence on tactical bands.

ashfall-lore-stress-burnout-4 = Shows zero shock in the face of carnage—silently applies tourniquets or slots spare breakers.

ashfall-lore-stress-burnout-5 = When compartment loss is certain, strolls without haste toward the nearest viable airlock.

ashfall-lore-stress-pedant-1 = Clings stubbornly to checklist bullet points, freezing if an emergency defies documented procedures.

ashfall-lore-stress-pedant-2 = Demands formal verbal confirmations even as compartment bulkheads buckle under pressure.

ashfall-lore-stress-pedant-3 = Spends critical seconds pulling exhaustive error logs rather than attempting an improvised field bypass.

ashfall-lore-stress-pedant-4 = Fiercely resists ungrounded patch jobs, arguing passionately against violating schematics under fire.

ashfall-lore-stress-pedant-5 = Snaps loudly at fleeing crew who disregard basic airlock cycling protocols during alarms.

ashfall-lore-stress-diplomat-1 = Diffuses cabin panic through measured speech, assigning simple tasks and reassuring shaken crew.

ashfall-lore-stress-diplomat-2 = Dodges sole liability for forced breaches or life-support rationing, constantly seeking peer consensus.

ashfall-lore-stress-diplomat-3 = Promptly aligns with the most organized and heavily armed contingent on the station when law breaks down.

ashfall-lore-stress-diplomat-4 = Readily negotiates with mutineers or raiders if it guarantees the survival of their colleagues.

ashfall-lore-stress-diplomat-5 = Acts as an impartial intermediary in civil strife, withholding open allegiance until the dust settles.

ashfall-lore-stress-daredevil-1 = Rides an adrenaline surge: throws themselves straight into the hazard on pure instinct and reflex.

ashfall-lore-stress-daredevil-2 = Ignores shrapnel cuts and thermal burns, driving relentlessly forward while adrenaline lasts.

ashfall-lore-stress-daredevil-3 = Incapable of turtling in cover—demands to patch exterior breaches manually or breach barriers head-on.

ashfall-lore-stress-daredevil-4 = Laughs loudly or trades venomous insults with impending doom, bolstering terrified comrades.

ashfall-lore-stress-daredevil-5 = Seizes control during command vacuums, issuing extraordinarily audacious and risky orders.

ashfall-lore-stress-stoic-1 = Preserves stone-faced calm while alarms wail and ceiling struts collapse around them.

ashfall-lore-stress-stoic-2 = Systematically addresses failures one by one, even when chances of saving the compartment are slim.

ashfall-lore-stress-stoic-3 = Refuses to be distracted while holding a main isolator valve that shields adjacent residential decks.

ashfall-lore-stress-stoic-4 = Faces fatal odds on their feet without sinking into histrionics, begging, or blind panic.

ashfall-lore-stress-stoic-5 = Carries an incapacitated partner through smoke-choked corridors for miles without a whimper.

ashfall-lore-stress-unathi-1 = Enters an ancestral battle trance under mortal threat, ignoring agony and striking with bare claws.

ashfall-lore-stress-unathi-2 = Suffers deeply from rapid vacuum chills, desperately securing emergency thermals and insulation.

ashfall-lore-stress-luam-1 = Terrified of raging open fire: recoils on instinct at flares, temporarily losing balance and poise.

ashfall-lore-stress-luam-2 = Pins antennae flat with palms when acoustic alarms peak, freezing in place until shockwaves settle.

ashfall-lore-stress-arachnid-1 = Navigates deck plate vibrations sharper than sensors, pinpointing structural breaches in utter blackness.

ashfall-lore-stress-arachnid-2 = Reflexively retreats into the narrowest subterranean cable races when main hulls rupture.

ashfall-lore-stress-veiru-1 = Bristles and lets out a low, rumbling growl under pressure, halting surrounding chaos with raw presence.

ashfall-lore-stress-veiru-2 = Catches the scent of ozone and scorched cables long before automatic detectors trip.

ashfall-lore-stress-universal-1 = Becomes completely uncommunicative under stress, replying only with clipped monosyllables.

ashfall-lore-stress-universal-2 = Clenches jaw until teeth grind, forcing one foot in front of the other through paralyzing dread.

# --- QUIRK ---
ashfall-lore-quirk-pragmatist-1 = Carries a worn pocket ledger where debts, lent gear, and maintenance dates are meticulously jotted down.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pragmatist-2 = Slowly counts tools or rounds inside pockets whenever an interlocutor dodges a straightforward question.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pragmatist-3 = Demonstratively scrutinizes every single line and footnote before putting down a signature.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pragmatist-4 = Stores spare cells and emergency rations in a personal locker secured with an extra padlock.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pragmatist-5 = Never tosses wire zip-ties or spare bolts, bundling them neatly 'for a rainy day.'

ashfall-lore-quirk-idealist-1 = Treasures an old academy lapel pin or insignia, polishing it to a mirror sheen during downtime.

ashfall-lore-quirk-idealist-2 = Straightens their collar and uniform badges every time before stepping out onto public corridors.

ashfall-lore-quirk-idealist-3 = Routinely offers hot coffee or biscuits to coworkers looking exhausted after long shifts.

ashfall-lore-quirk-idealist-4 = Involuntarily quotes corporate charters and ethical guidelines as moral arguments in arguments.

ashfall-lore-quirk-idealist-5 = Speaks noticeably faster and gestures emphatically whenever emotionally moved or anxious.

ashfall-lore-quirk-paranoid-1 = Keeps an emergency respirator around the neck even inside residential sectors with pristine air.

ashfall-lore-quirk-paranoid-2 = Habitually inspects ceiling corners and duct grates for unlisted telemetry bugs or listening taps.

ashfall-lore-quirk-paranoid-3 = Scribbles timestamps of anomalous announcements directly onto the sleeve of their jumpsuit.

ashfall-lore-quirk-paranoid-4 = Never sips from open mugs and accepts rations only if the security seal is broken in plain view.

ashfall-lore-quirk-paranoid-5 = Regularly glances sharply over the shoulder while traversing long, echoing service corridors.

ashfall-lore-quirk-burnout-1 = Chugs lukewarm, bitter synthetic coffee out of oversized one-liter insulated mugs all shift.

ashfall-lore-quirk-burnout-2 = Emits a profound, weary sigh into the microphone before answering any incoming dispatcher call.

ashfall-lore-quirk-burnout-3 = Carries a battered multitool scarred with notches for every past decommissioned facility.

ashfall-lore-quirk-burnout-4 = Tiredly pinches the bridge of the nose whenever someone launches into an upbeat presentation.

ashfall-lore-quirk-burnout-5 = Stalls filing administrative requisitions until the absolute final disciplinary warning from command.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pedant-1 = Aligns tools on the workbench strictly by gauge, length, and handle orientation.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pedant-2 = Uses a red grease pencil to mark grammatical errors and technical typos in communal logbooks.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pedant-3 = Carries a precision caliper and checks panel gaps whenever waiting idly for airlocks to cycle.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pedant-4 = Compulsively checks that every cuff strap is fastened and gloves are tucked according to code.

ashfall-lore-quirk-pedant-5 = Syncs wristwatch second hands against the primary station atomic clock every few hours.

ashfall-lore-quirk-diplomat-1 = Remembers the names, home colonies, and preferred tea blends of all department heads.

ashfall-lore-quirk-diplomat-2 = Maintains a mild, polite smile and slightly tilts their head, conveying complete undivided attention.

ashfall-lore-quirk-diplomat-3 = Keeps premium mints or tobacco packets solely as lubrication for opening conversations.

ashfall-lore-quirk-diplomat-4 = Lowers hands and takes a measured step back during arguments to visibly signal de-escalation.

ashfall-lore-quirk-diplomat-5 = Pauses politely and surveys the compartment before floating sensitive requests or rumors.

ashfall-lore-quirk-daredevil-1 = Sports fresh plasma scorch scars on forearms, recounting their origins with unapologetic bravado.

ashfall-lore-quirk-daredevil-2 = Wears uniform jumpsuits unbuttoned low or with sleeves rolled high, thumbing their nose at dress codes.

ashfall-lore-quirk-daredevil-3 = Flips a heavy wrench between fingers or tosses a spark lighter whenever idle boredom sets in.

ashfall-lore-quirk-daredevil-4 = Whistles a jaunty, irreverent tune right beneath blaring alarms or while splicing live conduits.

ashfall-lore-quirk-daredevil-5 = Proposes settling shift squabbles or task assignments with a fast, high-stakes coin flip.

ashfall-lore-quirk-stoic-1 = Holds an unblinking stare through conversational pauses, completely unbothered by silence.

ashfall-lore-quirk-stoic-2 = Slowly cracks thick, calloused knuckles in a rhythmic ritual before commencing hard labor.

ashfall-lore-quirk-stoic-3 = Keeps quarters austerely barren: spare thermals, an iron mug, and work garments on a hook.

ashfall-lore-quirk-stoic-4 = Eats cafeteria rations in complete silence, eyes downward, even if brawls break out nearby.

ashfall-lore-quirk-stoic-5 = Speaks in a rumbling, gravelly baritone that vibrates faintly against light aluminum partitions.

ashfall-lore-quirk-unathi-1 = Touches forehead reverently to the hilt of a waist blade before eating or commencing serious work.

ashfall-lore-quirk-unathi-2 = Habitually inspects thermal seal bands on suit sleeves, instinctively dreading cold deep space.

ashfall-lore-quirk-luam-1 = Grooms sensitive antennae with a fine natural bristle brush multiple times across a shift.

ashfall-lore-quirk-luam-2 = Drapes cabin lamps with layers of rough fabric to produce a soothing, dimmed twilight.

ashfall-lore-quirk-arachnid-1 = Idly weaves intricate mnemonic knots into fine silk cords while pondering technical puzzles.

ashfall-lore-quirk-arachnid-2 = Scrapes boot treads meticulously clear of iron filings before entering clean technical bays.

ashfall-lore-quirk-veiru-1 = Discreetly sniffs ventilation outlets when entering unfamiliar modules to gauge air quality.

ashfall-lore-quirk-veiru-2 = Frequently rolls shoulders and stretches neck, restless from days confined in low-ceiling decks.

ashfall-lore-quirk-universal-1 = Always carries a chipped ceramic mug with an almost faded corporate crest from a prior gig.

ashfall-lore-quirk-universal-2 = Listens to quiet ambient frequency static through earphones during lonely graveyard shifts.

# --- ARRIVAL HISTORY ---
ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-1 = Arrived on planned sector personnel rotation after concluding a five-year contract aboard an orbital platform.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-2 = Signed an extended remote posting contract to earn hardship hazard premiums for family mortgage payments.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-3 = Dispatched to the sector under corporate junior placement following graduation from technical college.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-4 = Transferred from a decommissioning mine due to vein exhaustion and mothballing of lower shafts.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-5 = Arrived under a technical exchange initiative to assist with upgrading station atmospheric systems.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-6 = Signed a frontier deployment contract aiming to save seed capital to launch an independent repair shop.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-7 = Assigned as reinforcement for shift crews undergoing a scheduled audit of power grid systems.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-8 = Transferred to follow family reassigned under administrative orders within this sector.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-9 = Requested a remote post far from core worlds, exhausted by the grinding bureaucracy of metropolitan arcologies.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-10 = Dispatched on logistics audit duty to bring sector freight and depot inventories into regulatory compliance.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-11 = Arrived among a contingent of freelance contractors under a fixed three-year subcontract agreement.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-12 = Reassigned following crew disbandment during regional corporate branch restructuring.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-13 = Chose this harsh sector for pension seniority multiplier: one year on station counts as eighteen months.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-14 = Assigned to the station for mandatory two-year field practice prior to master certification.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-15 = Transferred from deep recon flotillas to fixed station duty following medical clearance recommendations.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-16 = Arrived on regular security rotation designed to curb fraternization among veteran shift contingents.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-17 = Accepted transfer to less frantic shifts following severe burnout at a regional logistics nexus.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-18 = Signed a standard work visa: four seasons on frontier outposts in exchange for core-world residency status.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-19 = Commissioned to oversee filtration overhaul with seamless transition onto the permanent station roster.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-20 = Transferred away from an overstaffed sector where engineers sat idle for months waiting for active berths.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-21 = Arrived following family tradition: both parents originally started their technical careers in this sector.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-22 = Took on the contract to pay for specialized medical therapies for a family dependent on Earth.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-23 = Transferred from an academic laboratory to gather field telemetry under long-duration space isolation.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-24 = Sold off a stake in an aging scrap hauler and joined corporate service for stable benefits and wages.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-25 = Dispatched to the outpost on recommendation from a foreman who valued relentless rigor during audits.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-26 = Downsized when automated cranes replaced yard technicians, immediately accepting the first open posting.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-27 = Signed on for the enterprise medical rider covering rare chronic exposure conditions.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-28 = Arrived as a veteran mentor to guide incoming apprentices through high-pressure machinery protocols.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-29 = Transferred from deep ocean drilling rigs, preferring dry space vacuum over crushing oceanic pressure.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-30 = Assigned to the station as an elected delegate for the independent maintenance technicians' union.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-31 = Took an assignment in the outer belt to put several light-years of distance from family litigation.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-32 = Reassigned to aid the ongoing expansion of the station's heavy reactor and engineering wings.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-33 = Mustered out from a decommissioned research vessel whose hull was scheduled for orbital scrap breakers.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-34 = Signed on for company bunking and rations amidst deep manufacturing layoffs across the homeworld.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-35 = Dispatched to assist cleanup after a technical blowout in an adjacent wing, extending into permanent duty.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-36 = Transferred under sponsorship of an old superintendent promising fast-track promotion upon clean shift completion.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-37 = Arrived to conduct specialized hull-fatigue surveys ahead of five-year station recertification.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-38 = Took the posting to secure clearance for research archives exclusively accessible at this facility.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-39 = Transferred with citations after concluding emergency relief operations on a stranded freight convoy.

ashfall-lore-arrival-routine-40 = Assigned to the station under corporate generational turnover initiatives for technical shift staff.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-1 = Exiled to frontier duty by a disciplinary board after concealing an industrial workplace accident.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-2 = Hastily took the first open outer-rim berth to vanish from syndicate loan enforcement enforcers.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-3 = Serving a mandatory three-year restorative labor contract to repay corporate property losses.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-4 = Reassigned under fresh credentials after testifying to internal security against a corrupt director.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-5 = Fled metropolitan bankruptcy, abandoning sealed workshops and mounting court summons.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-6 = Sent on 'courtesy banishment' after publicly clashing with an influential corporate auditor.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-7 = Sole survivor of a catastrophic compartment blowout; took distant orders hoping to outrun memories.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-8 = Signed an irrevocable waiver contract, assuming the crushing debts of an incapacitated relative.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-9 = Lying low after a crate of illicit cargo vanished during their watch at a transshipment hub.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-10 = Placed on station duty under discreet internal observation after spearheading a dock strike.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-11 = Fled to deep space amid a ruinous divorce dispute that threatened financial insolvency.

ashfall-lore-arrival-drama-12 = Blacklisted from core systems; this isolated outpost was the only facility willing to look past their record.

ashfall-lore-arrival-unathi-1 = Dispatched to settle an oath of honor in foreign territory under orders from Kha-Ssar clan elders.

ashfall-lore-arrival-unathi-2 = Departed clan wastelands to master human high-voltage reactors and bring technical knowledge home.

ashfall-lore-arrival-luam-1 = Traveled from silk spires seeking rare catalytic minerals and polymers for weavers' guilds.

ashfall-lore-arrival-luam-2 = Separated from the Luam nomad fleet after disputing clan decrees regarding trade embargoes.

ashfall-lore-arrival-arachnid-1 = Commissioned by subterranean artisan guilds to mount and service complex suspended cable webs.

ashfall-lore-arrival-arachnid-2 = Migrated away from crowded colony caverns in search of independent quarters and steady contracts.

ashfall-lore-arrival-veiru-1 = Recruited under mercenary scout terms to patrol perimeter supply avenues and hangar perimeters.

ashfall-lore-arrival-veiru-2 = Voluntarily departed pride frontiers to prove independence and capability among alien stars.
